# Build Instructions

When building using claude.md, create the build output in the `agent_build` folder.

## Steps

1. Run the build command from the project root
2. Specify `agent_build` as the output directory
3. Build artifacts will be generated in `/agent_build`

## Project Structure

```
project-root/
├── agent_build/      # Build output directory
│   ├──src/              # Source code files
│   ├──test/             # Test files
│   ├──docs/             # Documentation
```

## Build Command

```bash
npm run build -- --output agent_build
